          "message": "Fix migrations for recovery & parachain-system pallets (#12123)\n\nChanges:\n- pallet-recovery: be more lenient towards broken accounts to keep their\nrecovery config and write storage version 🤦\n- parachain-system: clear old storage value to prevent decoding error,\nsee discussion\n[here](https://github.com/paritytech/polkadot-sdk/pull/10477#discussion_r3264157119)\n- pallet-assets: fix logs in migration\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Oliver Tale-Yazdi <oliver.tale-yazdi@parity.io>",
